{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：09:50 2026-09-02 HKT</p>\n\n<p>青衣長康邨康豐樓對開，今（2日)早上8時59分，一名年約40多歲男子疑由高處墮下，昏迷不醒，救援人員接報到場，經檢驗後證實當場不治，現場遺下一對鞋，警方圍封登樓調查死者身份及其墮樓原因。</p>\n<img alt=\"墮樓男子當場不治。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/be68814b30d8f02f1786a6afacb77aac/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-02_at_09_38_36_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"消防接報到場。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e0e09392e8cdceaaf3374596a01a28f8/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-02_at_09_38_36_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/11f31e9206e8e3ec22baebc8bd032703/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-02_at_09_38_36.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/41da8423d4c0b0189d9da3562e74639c/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-02_at_09_38_35.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b3d0deffdc680c8e238c17cfcc2e477b/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-02_at_09_38_37.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T02:03:58.387002+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}